2026-07-27T14:26:18.0110605Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:26:18.0110973Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:26:18.0111612Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:26:18.0112480Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:26:18.0113502Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
